=   entry .Error   raised when a candidate cannot be staged
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.140.1`: _could not stage the upgrade because `reason`_, raised by `Upgrade.stage`.
-         The reason is a `Clarification`, so the full code is `↯/s.140.1.1` to `↯/s.140.1.3`:
-         `CannotReadSource` (1) — _the upgrade source could not be read_; `CannotWritePending`
-         (2) — _the .pending file could not be written_; `CannotResolveName` (3) — _the
-         running application's name is not available_, which is the case for a JVM run
-         without a launcher.
-     entry .Reason   why the candidate could not be staged
+         Errore `↯/s.140.1`: _could not stage the upgrade because `reason`_, sollevato da
+         `Upgrade.stage`. Il motivo è una `Clarification`, quindi il codice completo va da
+         `↯/s.140.1.1` a `↯/s.140.1.3`: `CannotReadSource` (1) — _the upgrade source could not
+         be read_; `CannotWritePending` (2) — _the .pending file could not be written_;
+         `CannotResolveName` (3) — _the running application's name is not available_, come
+         accade per una JVM eseguita senza un launcher.
+     entry .Reason   perché il candidato non ha potuto essere depositato

